<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Peace Hill shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of beverages manufacturer and distributor Peace Hill Enterprise Group Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Peace Hill shares ended HK$0.225 or 6.34 percent up at HK$3.775 a share on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
